Summary: Allow or forbid one body to sleep.

pBody: The body handle.

pFlag: true to let the body sleep, false to keep it always awake.

Example:
b2EnableSleep tPlayer, false

Description:
A stale or 0 handle is a harmless no-op.

References: b2BodyIsSleepEnabled (handler), b2EnableSleeping (handler)
*/
