Description:
A stale or 0 handle returns 0.

References: b2ShapeClosestPointX (handler), b2ShapeTestPoint (handler)
*/
public handler b2ShapeClosestPointY(in pShape as Integer, in pTargetX as Number, in pTargetY as Number) returns Number
   variable tR as Number
   unsafe
      put _shape_closest_point_y(pShape, pTargetX, pTargetY) into tR
   end unsafe
   return tR
end handler

/**
Summary: Snapshot one shape's mass data.

pShape: The shape handle.

Example:
b2ShapeMassDataUpdate tShape
put b2MassDataMass() into tMass

Description:
Read it with <b2MassDataMass>, <b2MassDataCenterX>, <b2MassDataCenterY>
and <b2MassDataInertia>. A stale handle zeroes the snapshot.

References: b2MassDataMass (handler), b2BodyMassDataUpdate (handler)
*/
public handler b2ShapeMassDataUpdate(in pShape as Integer)
   unsafe
      _shape_mass_data_update(pShape)
   end unsafe
end handler

/**
Summary: Return how many overlaps a sensor shape may report.

pShape: The shape handle.

Returns: Box2D's capacity for the sensor's overlap list; 0 for a stale
handle.

Example:
put b2ShapeSensorCapacity(tZone) into tMax

Description:
An upper bound on what <b2ShapeSensorOverlapsUpdate> can return.

References: b2ShapeSensorOverlapsUpdate (handler)
*/
public handler b2ShapeSensorCapacity(in pShape as Integer) returns Integer
   variable tR as Integer
   unsafe
      put _shape_sensor_capacity(pShape) into tR
   end unsafe
   return tR
end handler

/**
Summary: Snapshot the shapes overlapping a sensor now.

pShape: The shape handle.

Returns: The number of overlapping shapes.

Example:
repeat with i = 1 to b2ShapeSensorOverlapsUpdate(tZone)
   put b2ShapeBody(b2ShapeSensorOverlapAt(i)) & cr after tInside
end repeat

Description:
A poll, unlike the begin and end events of <b2SensorsUpdate>. Read each
shape with <b2ShapeSensorOverlapAt>. A stale handle returns 0.

References: b2ShapeSensorOverlapAt (handler), b2SensorsUpdate (handler)
*/
public handler b2ShapeSensorOverlapsUpdate(in pShape as Integer) returns Integer
   variable tR as Integer
   unsafe
      put _shape_sensor_overlaps_update(pShape) into tR
   end unsafe
   return tR
end handler

/**
