Description:
The same number <b2ShapeSensorOverlapsUpdate> returned.

References: b2ShapeSensorOverlapsUpdate (handler)
*/
public handler b2ShapeSensorOverlapCount() returns Integer
   variable tR as Integer
   unsafe
      put _shape_sensor_overlap_count() into tR
   end unsafe
   return tR
end handler

/**
Summary: Return one shape from the sensor overlap snapshot.

pIndex: The 1-based index, from 1 to <b2ShapeSensorOverlapCount>.

Returns: A shape handle, or 0 when the index is out of range.

